<<<
let. Mistakes in case are very rare in English; forgetfulness of the construction, when l. is used in exhortations, is responsible for a wrong subjective now & then:—And now, my dear, let you & I say
===
**let.** Mistakes in case are very rare in English; forgetfulness of the construction, when *l.* is used in exhortations, is responsible for a wrong subjective now & then:—*And now, my dear,* let you & I *say*
>>>

